//
// Requires plugin_manager_write. Each document must verify against the configured issuer trust. An organization grant must match exactly the installation UUID, plugin and organization of an enablement; an installation-wide grant (no organization) must match the installation UUID and plugin of an installed, active or disabled installation, also before any organization is enabled, and covers every organization without a grant of its own, including organizations created later. A higher sequence replaces the current grant of the same binding (plugin, installation and organization, or plugin and installation). A rejected document is reported and never blocks the others. Imports take effect without a restart.
